This is an example website. It sets no cookies and loads no tracking scripts.

## Contact forms and email

When you write to us, we use your message and your address only to answer you. We delete them when the conversation ends, unless the law asks us to keep them for longer.

## Server logs

The web server may keep short access logs for security reasons. The logs contain no names, and we do not link them to people. We delete them after seven days.

## Your rights

You can ask us what personal data we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it. We answer within one month.

## Questions

Write to privacy@harborlane.example.
